    💭 Absolute form and *
    🆕📨 🔤GET🔤 🔤http://example.com/p?q=1🔤❗️ ➡️ absolute
    🔡 check 🔤an absolute target has no problem🔤 🚩 absolute❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤an absolute target gives the path🔤 🛣 absolute❗️ 🔤/p🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤an absolute target sets Host🔤 🏷 absolute 🔤host🔤❗️ 🔤example.com🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤an absolute target keeps its query🔤 🔎 absolute 🔤q🔤❗️ 🔤1🔤❗️
    🆕📨 🔤GET🔤 🔤HTTP://Example.com🔤❗️ ➡️ bare
    🔡 check 🔤an absolute target without a path is the root🔤 🛣 bare❗️ 🔤/🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤the authority is kept as written🔤 🏷 bare 🔤host🔤❗️ 🔤Example.com🔤❗️
    🆕📨 🔤GET🔤 🔤http://example.com?x=1🔤❗️ ➡️ queryOnly
    🔡 check 🔤an absolute target with only a query is the root🔤 🛣 queryOnly❗️ 🔤/🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤and keeps that query🔤 🔎 queryOnly 🔤x🔤❗️ 🔤1🔤❗️
    🆕📨 🔤OPTIONS🔤 🔤*🔤❗️ ➡️ star
    👌 check 🔤* is recognised🔤 ✳️ star❗️❗️
    🔡 check 🔤* has no problem🔤 🚩 star❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤* is its own path🔤 🛣 star❗️ 🔤*🔤❗️
    👌 check 🔤a path is not *🔤 ❎ ✳️ absolute❗️❗️❗️

    💭 Query
    🆕📨 🔤GET🔤 🔤/x?a=1&b=two+words&a=3&=skipped&flag&c=%F0%9F%8D%87&d=1%2B1🔤❗️ ➡️ q
    🔡 check 🔤a query does not make a problem🔤 🚩 q❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤the query is not part of the path🔤 🛣 q❗️ 🔤/x🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤🔎 gives the first value🔤 🔎 q 🔤a🔤❗️ 🔤1🔤❗️
    🔡 check 🔤🔭 gives every value in order🔤 🆕🔡 🔭 q 🔤a🔤❗️ 🔤|🔤❗️ 🔤1|3🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤a plus sign is a space in the query🔤 🔎 q 🔤b🔤❗️ 🔤two words🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤a name without a value has an empty value🔤 🔎 q 🔤flag🔤❗️ 🔤🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤escapes decode in the query🔤 🔎 q 🔤c🔤❗️ 🔤🍇🔤❗️
    🎁 check 🔤an encoded plus stays a plus🔤 🔎 q 🔤d🔤❗️ 🔤1+1🔤❗️
    🕳 check 🔤a missing name has no value🔤 🔎 q 🔤missing🔤❗️❗️
    🔢 check 🔤a missing name has no values🔤 📏 🔭 q 🔤missing🔤❗️❓ 0❗️
    🔡 check 🔤🗝 lists each name once, in order, without the empty one🔤 🆕🔡 🗝 q❗️ 🔤|🔤❗️ 🔤a|b|flag|c|d🔤❗️

